		{"id":"55785218ae3a4074","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260712194702.png","x":-4619,"y":2257,"width":400,"height":113},
		{
			"id":"c51f9a0ff961f664",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**严谨证明** （可参考 [[2009,1,18,拉格朗日中值、导数极限定理]]）\n\n![[Pasted image 20260712222814.png|911]]",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-4460,
			"y":5010,
			"width":1000,
			"height":460
		},
		{
			"id":"083a93b6fb1ccdec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[导数极限定理 - 千羽](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14aiSB3EWi?spm_id_from=333.788.videopod.sections&vd_source=5e53118bdffba34d123bb97d9a7caf9a&p=5) \n\n![[Pasted image 20260712230701.png]]",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-5808,
			"y":5540,
			"width":1140,
			"height":860
		},
		{"id":"446c1d125aeef396","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260712225324.png","x":-4940,"y":4320,"width":542,"height":550},
		{"id":"57c4d9b61f8099aa","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_x7DRoq.png","x":-2480,"y":1166,"width":597,"height":387},
		{"id":"02fbf2559b59b851","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_47J3Ax.png","x":-2480,"y":1643,"width":621,"height":404,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3e7ab56d28d84dae","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260712225122.png","x":-3820,"y":3662,"width":466,"height":545},
		{
			"id":"04b577de36c3083c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"⭐选择填空经常考察",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2297,
			"y":2160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"fab8e0bf59a2d15b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**感性证明**（好记）\n\n由原函数存在定理可知，导函数若存在的话，要么连续，要么有震荡间断点，若**加上导函数极限存在**，则排除了震荡间断点的情况，因此推出导函数连续，即导函数的极限值等于导函数的函数值。",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-5778,
			"y":5030,
			"width":1000,
			"height":440
		},
		{"id":"900b77a7ff14d9a7","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260712202907.png","x":-5700,"y":3640,"width":844,"height":582},
